// PSP Mock Test 02 — 140 questions transcribed from the source test.
// d: domain (A = Physical Security Assessment, D = Application, Design & Integration, I = Implementation)
// q: question, o: options, a: index of the answer marked correct in the source, e: explanation (Arabic)
window.QUESTIONS = [
{d:"D",q:"You are designing a surveillance system for a high-security facility. During the installation of CCTV cameras, the client expresses concern about the cameras’ ability to detect movement in low-light conditions. The technician mentions adjusting the “sensitivity” settings to improve performance. In this context, what does sensitivity refer to?",o:["The minimum amount of light required by the camera to produce an image","The critical measure of picture quality and specifically is the horizontal scan lines or digital pixel arrays that the camera captures","Both A and B","None of the above"],a:0,e:"الحساسية (Sensitivity) هي أقل كمية ضوء تحتاجها الكاميرا لتعطي صورة صالحة، وتقاس عادة باللوكس (Lux). كلما قل الرقم كانت الكاميرا أفضل في الإضاءة الضعيفة. أما الخيار B فهو تعريف الدقة (Resolution) وليس الحساسية."},
{d:"I",q:"A corporate procurement team releases a detailed 20–30 page RFP for a fully integrated security system (CCTV, ACS, IDS). You’re advising them on bidder expectations and documentation workload. Based on industry norms, how large is the typical response package from bidders?",o:["20 to 30","40 to 60","60 to 70","60 to 80"],a:1,e:"رد المورّد على طلب العروض (RFP) يكون عادة ضعف حجم الطلب تقريباً، أي 40 إلى 60 صفحة. السبب أن المورّد يضيف الحل الفني ومواصفات المعدات والجدول الزمني والتسعير والسيرة المهنية للفريق."},
{d:"D",q:"During a physical security audit, you inspect a door with a beveled bolt that retracts as the door closes and springs back into place to secure the door automatically. What type of bolt is being described?",o:["Spring loaded bolt","Deadbolt","Latch bolt","Electric lock"],a:2,e:"لسان القفل المائل (Latch bolt) ينضغط عند إغلاق الباب ثم يرجع بنابض ليثبّت الباب تلقائياً. الـ Deadbolt لا يكون مائلاً ولا يعمل بنابض، ولا بد من تحريكه يدوياً بالمفتاح أو المقبض، لذلك هو أقوى أمنياً."},
{d:"I",q:"A hospital reports frequent nuisance alarms from alarmed exit doors—mostly due to staff behavior and housekeeping carts nudging doors. The facility wants a sustained reduction in false alarms. Which action is most effective in reducing these alarms over time?",o:["Deactivating the alarm","Attaching a timed audible bell to the door latch","Increase the amount of security patrols in and around the door","Examine the maintenance program to ensure that doors are kept in good operation"],a:3,e:"الإنذارات الكاذبة المتكررة سببها غالباً أبواب لا تُغلق جيداً أو أقفال ومفصلات تالفة. الحل الدائم هو برنامج صيانة يحافظ على عمل الأبواب بشكل صحيح. إيقاف الإنذار يلغي الحماية، وزيادة الدوريات مكلفة ولا تعالج السبب."},
{d:"D",q:"An intrusion detection system is configured to alarm only after multiple detection pulses occur within a set time window. What technique is being used?",o:["Ambience shifting","Dual sensor activation","Pulse-count activation","Plus and minus monitoring"],a:2,e:"تقنية عدّ النبضات (Pulse-count activation) لا تطلق الإنذار إلا بعد عدد معين من الاكتشافات خلال فترة زمنية محددة. هذا يقلل الإنذارات الكاذبة الناتجة عن حدث عابر واحد مثل حيوان صغير أو تيار هواء."},
{d:"D",q:"During CCTV system planning, stakeholders propose buying premium cameras first and designing around their specs. The security consultant argues for beginning with requirements and risks instead. Which approach represents best practice?",o:["Ensure the user determines their needs and only then select the equipment","Design the application before establishing the budget","Ensure the application chooses the equipment","All of the above"],a:3,e:"القاعدة الأساسية في تصميم CCTV: المتطلبات أولاً ثم المعدات. يحدد المستخدم احتياجه، ثم يُصمَّم التطبيق، والتطبيق هو الذي يحدد نوع المعدات. لذلك كل العبارات صحيحة، وشراء الكاميرات قبل التصميم خطأ شائع."},
{d:"I",q:"You’re finalizing the PPS budget for a new enterprise system. The CFO asks: “How much should we allocate for end-user training as a percentage of total system cost?” What is the typical budget allocation for end-user training?",o:["3–5 percent of total cost","10–15 percent of total cost","15–20 percent of total cost","20–25 percent of total cost"],a:0,e:"المعيار المتعارف عليه لتدريب المستخدمين النهائيين هو 3 إلى 5% من التكلفة الكلية للنظام. هذا رقم يُحفظ للامتحان."},
{d:"D",q:"A high-rise facility must address fire, chemical, and explosive hazards. Which control measures should be implemented?",o:["An emergency procedures plan which is regularly tested","Fire extinguishment, containment or replacement of contaminated air","Shutoff or filtration of drinking water and containment and removal of explosives","B and C"],a:3,e:"الخياران B وC يغطيان الإجراءات المادية المباشرة: إطفاء الحريق واحتواء الهواء الملوث أو استبداله، وقطع مياه الشرب أو تصفيتها واحتواء المتفجرات وإزالتها. خطة الطوارئ (A) مهمة، لكنها إجراء إداري وليست وسيلة تحكم بالخطر نفسه."},
{d:"D",q:"A security designer is comparing camera models to determine which camera has a better resolution and provides detailed image for facial identification at entrances. Which characteristic defines resolution?",o:["The minimum amount of light required by the camera to produce an image","The critical measure of picture quality and specifically is the horizontal scan lines or digital pixel arrays that the camera captures","Both A and B","None of the above"],a:1,e:"الدقة (Resolution) هي مقياس جودة الصورة: عدد خطوط المسح الأفقية في الكاميرات التناظرية، أو عدد البكسلات في الكاميرات الرقمية. الخيار A هو تعريف الحساسية. قارن هذا السؤال بالسؤال 1."},
{d:"A",q:"PPS design begins with perimeter protection, then adds controls at building shells, interior zones, and finally asset-level protection, creating multiple defense layers. Which approach is being applied?",o:["Physical Security Survey","Outside-In","Risk Analysis","Inside-Out"],a:1,e:"نهج من الخارج إلى الداخل (Outside-In) يبدأ من المحيط الخارجي ثم غلاف المبنى ثم المناطق الداخلية ثم الأصل نفسه. هذا هو مبدأ الحماية المتعددة الطبقات (Protection-in-depth)، وكل طبقة تؤخر المهاجم وتزيد فرصة اكتشافه."},
{d:"A",q:"You are finalizing a risk treatment plan for a corporate security program. The team debates what should be the scope of this document. Which item should be excluded from the risk treatment plan itself?",o:["Proposed actions","Resource requirements","Performance measures","Residual risk"],a:3,e:"خطة معالجة المخاطر تحتوي على الإجراءات المقترحة والموارد المطلوبة ومقاييس الأداء والمسؤوليات والجدول الزمني. المخاطر المتبقية (Residual risk) نتيجة تُقيَّم بعد تطبيق المعالجة، ولا تُعد بنداً في الخطة نفسها."},
{d:"D",q:"In these types of buildings, access is typically unrestricted at the building entry level and anyone can proceed directly to their destination floor where the occupier of that space determines the level of entry control and security. It is a?",o:["Open building","Closed building","Hybrid building","Controlled building"],a:0,e:"المبنى المفتوح (Open building): الدخول من المدخل الرئيسي غير مقيد، وكل مستأجر يتحكم بأمن طابقه. في المبنى المغلق (Closed building) يتم التحقق من الهوية عند المدخل أو المصاعد قبل الصعود. قارن بالسؤال 23."},
{d:"D",q:"Investigators review CCTV footage from a high-resolution camera and confirm the suspect’s identity beyond doubt. What level of identification does this represent?",o:["Subject identification","Action identification","Scene identification","None of the above"],a:0,e:"مستويات التعرف في CCTV ثلاثة: التعرف على الشخص (Subject)، وهو أعلاها ويحدد هوية الشخص بلا شك، ثم التعرف على الفعل (Action) أي ما حدث، ثم التعرف على المشهد (Scene) أي مكان الحدث. تأكيد الهوية بلا شك هو Subject identification."},
{d:"A",q:"A security manager is prioritizing mitigation options for a new facility. Which characteristic is least desirable when selecting mitigation measures?",o:["Large increase in probability in preventing aggressor attempt","Low cost","Small increase in probability in preventing aggressor attempt","Large increase in probability in preventing aggressor success"],a:2,e:"الإجراء الجيد يرفع احتمال منع المهاجم بدرجة كبيرة وبتكلفة منخفضة. الإجراء الذي لا يحقق إلا زيادة صغيرة في احتمال المنع هو الأقل جدوى، لأن فائدته ضعيفة مقارنة بتكلفته."},
{d:"D",q:"A military facility wants lighting that prevents intruders from seeing guard positions while maintaining perimeter visibility. Which lighting function achieves this?",o:["Glare projection","Controlled lighting","Continuous lighting","Standby lighting"],a:0,e:"إضاءة الوهج (Glare projection) توجَّه للخارج نحو المتسلل فتبهر عينيه وتخفي الحراس خلفها، مع إبقاء المحيط مرئياً. تُستخدم عندما لا تزعج الإضاءة الجيران أو الطرق المجاورة."},
{d:"A",q:"When evaluating mitigation options, which factor should NOT be used as a selection criterion?",o:["Implementation costs","Changes to operational costs","Levels of consequence","Nondependencies on the site infrastructures"],a:3,e:"معايير اختيار إجراءات التخفيف تشمل تكلفة التنفيذ والتغير في تكاليف التشغيل وتأثيرها على مستوى العواقب، كما تشمل الاعتماد على البنية التحتية للموقع. عبارة «عدم الاعتماد على البنية التحتية» ليست معياراً معتمداً."},
{d:"A",q:"A data breach exposes employee names and ID numbers. What type of data has been compromised?",o:["Photo Identification Information","Privacy Individual Information","Personal Identity Intelligence","Personally Identifiable Information (PII)"],a:3,e:"المعلومات الشخصية المحددة للهوية (PII) هي أي بيانات تحدد هوية شخص بعينه، مثل الاسم ورقم الهوية والعنوان. باقي الخيارات مصطلحات غير معتمدة."},
{d:"I",q:"Near project closeout, the project manager creates a document listing incomplete tasks and corrective actions. What is this document called?",o:["Change order","Punch list","WBD document","Scope statement"],a:1,e:"قائمة الملاحظات النهائية (Punch list) تُعد قرب نهاية المشروع، وتحصر الأعمال الناقصة أو المعيبة التي يجب على المقاول إصلاحها قبل الاستلام النهائي. أمر التغيير (Change order) يعدّل نطاق العقد."},
{d:"A",q:"A security risk assessment categorizes threats to a facility. An earthquake is identified as a potential hazard. From a risk management perspective, how is an earthquake classified?",o:["A natural risk","An Act of God risk","A pure risk","A business necessity risk"],a:2,e:"المخاطر نوعان: خطر بحت (Pure risk) فيه احتمال خسارة أو لا شيء ولا ربح فيه أبداً، مثل الزلزال والحريق والسرقة؛ وخطر مضاربي (Speculative risk) فيه احتمال ربح أو خسارة، مثل الاستثمار. الزلزال خطر بحت."},
{d:"D",q:"An access control system grants access to an unauthorized individual. How serious is the false acceptance error in terms of effective access control?",o:["Negligible","More serious than a false reject error","Acceptable at the ten percent level or less","Less serious than a false reject error"],a:1,e:"القبول الخاطئ (False accept، خطأ من النوع الثاني) يعني دخول شخص غير مصرح له، وهذا اختراق أمني فعلي. الرفض الخاطئ (False reject) يزعج المستخدم المصرح له فقط. لذلك القبول الخاطئ أخطر."},
{d:"I",q:"A security manager issues a document requesting technical and commercial proposals from vendors for a new PPS. What is this document called?",o:["Request for plans","Request for proposal","Request for Quotation","Invitation for Bids"],a:1,e:"طلب العروض (RFP) يطلب من المورّدين حلاً فنياً وعرضاً تجارياً معاً، ويُستخدم عندما يكون التصميم جزءاً من مسؤولية المورّد. طلب التسعير (RFQ) والدعوة للمناقصة (IFB) يركزان على السعر بعد اكتمال التصميم."},
{d:"I",q:"During acceptance testing of a newly installed security system, the integrator performs functional tests on all components. What is the primary purpose of functional testing?",o:["Maintenance programs match test conditions","Supplementary training for the systems operators","All components of the system comply with design specifications","The system will do what it is designed to do"],a:3,e:"الاختبار الوظيفي (Functional testing) يتحقق من أن النظام يؤدي ما صُمم من أجله في التشغيل الفعلي. أما مطابقة المكونات للمواصفات (C) فتُتحقق منها في الفحص والمطابقة وليس الاختبار الوظيفي."},
{d:"D",q:"A building restricts elevator access through credential checks and authenticates visitors before allowing vertical movement. What type of building is this?",o:["Open building","Closed building","Hybrid building","Controlled building"],a:1,e:"المبنى المغلق (Closed building): يتم التحقق من الهوية وتسجيل الزوار عند المدخل أو قبل استخدام المصاعد، فلا أحد يصل إلى الطوابق دون تصريح. هذا عكس المبنى المفتوح في السؤال 12."},
{d:"D",q:"A security lighting designer wants to select lighting levels that inhibit intruder activity. At which lighting level would a burglar be unable to manipulate locks effectively?",o:["Bright light","Darkness","Dim light","Low light"],a:1,e:"حسب الإجابة المعتمدة في المصدر: في الظلام التام لا يستطيع اللص أن يرى ما يفعله، فيصعب عليه العبث بالأقفال إلا بمصدر ضوء خاص، وهذا المصدر يكشفه. الإضاءة الخافتة تكفيه للعمل وتخفيه في الوقت نفسه."},
{d:"I",q:"A project owner has completed the system design and is ready to solicit pricing only. When should an Invitation for Bids be issued?",o:["When you are working on smaller projects with no predesign requirements","Where the requestor wishes to limit proposals to 3 or less","When the design component of the implementation has been separated from the contract component","Where the design has already been completed either in house or by a security consultant"],a:3,e:"الدعوة للمناقصة (IFB) تُستخدم عندما يكون التصميم مكتملاً، سواء داخلياً أو عبر استشاري، ولا يُطلب من المقاولين إلا السعر لتنفيذ تصميم محدد. الترسية تكون عادة لأقل سعر مطابق."},
{d:"I",q:"Incident response policies should be periodically reviewed by legal counsel and the legal review should ensure that procedures include several issues. Which statement is not true in relation to incident response procedures?",o:["They should comply with overall company policies and procedures","They should conform to local laws and regulations only","They should reflect known industry best practices demonstrating the exercise of due care","They should protect your staff from lawsuits"],a:1,e:"الخطأ في كلمة «فقط» (only). يجب أن تتوافق إجراءات الاستجابة مع القوانين المحلية والوطنية والفيدرالية والدولية عند الحاجة، وليس مع القوانين المحلية وحدها."},
{d:"D",q:"A security engineer categorizes interior sensors by function. Which option is NOT a valid sensor classification?",o:["Volumetric or line, covert or visible","Active, passive","Boundary penetration, building interior, object or proximity","Intercom, radio, telephone equipment"],a:3,e:"تُصنف الحساسات حسب: نوع التغطية (حجمي أو خطي)، والظهور (مخفي أو مرئي)، وطريقة العمل (نشط أو سلبي)، والموقع (اختراق حدود، داخل المبنى، حماية جسم أو قرب). الإنتركم والراديو والهاتف وسائل اتصال وليست حساسات."},
{d:"D",q:"Intrusion sensors are installed on the doors and windows of a store. When a sensor activates, an alarm is sent to a company that verifies the alarm before initiating a response. What type of monitoring is this?",o:["Contract monitoring","Central station monitoring","Proprietary monitoring","Remote monitoring"],a:1,e:"المراقبة عبر محطة مركزية (Central station) تعني أن شركة خارجية متخصصة تستقبل الإنذارات وتتحقق منها ثم تبلغ الشرطة أو الحراسة. المراقبة الخاصة (Proprietary) يديرها صاحب المنشأة بنفسه."},
{d:"I",q:"A facility maintains a key control program. How often should key system inventories be conducted at a minimum?",o:["Annually","Quarterly","Semi-annually","Monthly"],a:0,e:"الحد الأدنى لجرد نظام المفاتيح هو مرة كل سنة. المنشآت عالية الخطورة قد تجرد أكثر من ذلك، والمطلوب في الامتحان هو الحد الأدنى."},
{d:"D",q:"While selecting IP cameras, a designer reviews common camera categories. Which three styles are typically available?",o:["Analogue, digital and smart","Smart, standard and megapixel","Digital, thermal and smart","Smart, thermal and analogue"],a:1,e:"كاميرات IP تأتي بثلاثة أنماط: قياسية (Standard)، وميغابكسل (Megapixel) بدقة عالية، وذكية (Smart) فيها تحليلات مدمجة. التناظرية (Analogue) ليست من كاميرات IP أصلاً."},
{d:"D",q:"A facility requires cameras capable of operating in near-total darkness. What output are low-light cameras designed to produce?",o:["Good usable video images under lighting conditions equivalent to dusk or dawn","Good even pictures indoors under full consistent or minimally variable lighting conditions","Good usable/colored video/images where little or no light exists","None of the above"],a:2,e:"كاميرات الإضاءة المنخفضة جداً (Low-light) تعطي صوراً صالحة حتى في شبه الظلام التام. الفئة الأقل منها (Lower-light) مخصصة لإضاءة الغسق والفجر، وهي موضوع السؤال 38."},
{d:"I",q:"A security manager retains older versions of SOPs even after updates. Why is this practice of keeping older versions of operations procedures important?",o:["To track the history of response activations","To ascertain what policies and procedures were in effect at a certain time","To comply with company audit policy","To comply with the American National Standards Institute’s standard on operational procedures"],a:1,e:"الاحتفاظ بالنسخ القديمة يثبت ما كان سارياً في وقت معين، وهذا مهم في القضايا القانونية والتحقيقات. إذا وقعت حادثة قبل سنتين فالسؤال سيكون: ما الإجراء الذي كان معمولاً به وقتها؟"},
{d:"I",q:"During system installations laminated plastic nameplates should be provided for all major components of the system being installed. Each nameplate should identify the device and its location within the system. Where should these nameplates be attached?",o:["To the outside of the enclosure housing the major component","To the inside of the enclosure housing the major component","Anywhere the nameplate can be easily identified","To the major component"],a:1,e:"تُثبت لوحة التعريف داخل الصندوق الذي يضم المكوّن، حتى لا يعرف المتسلل نوع الجهاز أو دوره من الخارج، ويجدها الفني عند فتح الصندوق للصيانة."},
{d:"D",q:"A lighting designer evaluates lamp efficiency. How is lamp efficiency measured?",o:["Watt (of power input) per Lumen (of light output)","Lux","Foot Candles","Lumens (of light output) per watt (of power input)"],a:3,e:"كفاءة المصباح = لومن لكل واط (lm/W)، أي كمية الضوء الناتجة مقابل كل واط مستهلك. اللوكس والقدم-شمعة وحدات لشدة الإضاءة على سطح، وليست لكفاءة المصباح."},
{d:"D",q:"A security lighting plan includes 4 standard protective lighting types. Which option is NOT one of them?",o:["Continuous","Intermittent","Standby","Moveable"],a:1,e:"الأنواع الأربعة للإضاءة الأمنية: مستمرة (Continuous)، واحتياطية (Standby)، ومتنقلة (Movable)، وطوارئ (Emergency). المتقطعة (Intermittent) ليست منها."},
{d:"A",q:"A security manager reviews life-safety requirements for a facility. What primarily mandates these requirements?",o:["Local Fire/Safety Codes","International Fire/Safety Building codes","NFPA","Vulnerabilities identified during the building safety audits"],a:0,e:"متطلبات سلامة الأرواح تفرضها أساساً أكواد الحريق والسلامة المحلية، لأنها ملزمة قانونياً في مكان المنشأة. معايير NFPA والأكواد الدولية تُعتمد عادة ضمن هذه الأكواد المحلية."},
{d:"A",q:"When developing a security plan, which two phases are part of the development process?",o:["Risk analysis and implementation","Assets identification and Risk analysis","Security survey and vulnerability assessment","Security program design and staff awareness"],a:0,e:"مراحل تطوير الخطة الأمنية: تحليل المخاطر، ثم تصميم البرنامج، ثم التنفيذ، ثم الصيانة (قارن بالسؤال 131). من الخيارات المتاحة، المرحلتان «تحليل المخاطر» و«التنفيذ» هما من هذه المراحل."},
{d:"D",q:"A site requires cameras for twilight conditions rather than complete darkness. What output are lower-light cameras designed to produce?",o:["Good usable video images under lighting conditions equivalent to dusk or dawn","Good even pictures indoors under full consistent or minimally variable lighting conditions","Images where little or no light exists","None of the above"],a:0,e:"كاميرات Lower-light مصممة لإضاءة تعادل الغسق أو الفجر. انتبه للفرق: Low-light للظلام شبه التام (السؤال 31)، وLower-light للإضاءة الضعيفة."},
{d:"D",q:"Masterkeying is used to provide different levels of access to varying groups of locks. Three major potential problems exist when a master key system is used. Which of the following is not one of those problems?",o:["The loss, compromise or unauthorized use of the master key exposes all locks in the group","The multiple shear lines provide additional possibilities for manipulation of the lock","Additional parts required in the lock core create the need for additional maintenance","Key control records are more difficult to maintain"],a:3,e:"المشاكل الثلاث لنظام المفتاح الرئيسي: (1) فقدان المفتاح الرئيسي يكشف كل الأقفال، (2) تعدد خطوط القص يسهّل فتح القفل بالتلاعب، (3) القطع الإضافية تزيد الحاجة للصيانة. صعوبة السجلات ليست من الثلاث."},
{d:"D",q:"During a perimeter security design review for a high-risk facility, the consultant specifies lighting requirements for the exclusion zone. The standard states that illumination should be measured horizontally, 6 inches above the ground, and at least 30 feet outside the exclusion area toward the barrier. What minimum intensity must the perimeter band of lighting provide under these conditions?",o:["0.5 foot candles","0.3 foot candles","0.4 foot candles","0.2 foot candles"],a:3,e:"المعيار: 0.2 قدم-شمعة كحد أدنى، تُقاس أفقياً على ارتفاع 6 بوصات فوق الأرض وعلى بعد 30 قدماً على الأقل خارج منطقة الاستبعاد. رقم يُحفظ للامتحان."},
{d:"D",q:"A security manager reviews standards used to classify money safes for insurance and protection purposes. Besides UL, which organization also classifies money safes?",o:["The Bureau of Standards","The Insurance Services Office (ISO)","The FBI","The Federal Reserve Board"],a:1,e:"تصنَّف الخزائن المالية من جهتين: مختبرات UL، ومكتب خدمات التأمين (ISO) الذي تعتمده شركات التأمين لتحديد مستوى التغطية."},
{d:"I",q:"During preparation of security system specifications, several drawing types are required. Which drawing type is NOT relevant to a security installation?",o:["Elevations","Furniture layout","Risers","Floor plan"],a:1,e:"المخططات المطلوبة للتركيب الأمني: المساقط الأفقية (Floor plans)، والواجهات (Elevations)، والمخططات الرأسية للتمديدات (Risers)، والتفاصيل. مخطط الأثاث لا علاقة له بتركيب النظام الأمني."},
{d:"D",q:"A CCTV integrator is selecting a multiplexer configuration. What are the three common multiplexer formats?",o:["Simplex, sequential, digital","Analogue, digital, IP","Simplex, duplex, triplex","None of the above"],a:2,e:"صيغ المُجمِّع (Multiplexer) الثلاث: Simplex يسجل أو يعرض وظيفة واحدة في كل مرة، وDuplex يسجل ويعرض معاً، وTriplex يسجل ويعرض ويسترجع التسجيل في الوقت نفسه."},
{d:"A",q:"While conducting a threat assessment, a security analyst categorizes non-criminal threats. How are these threats generally classified?",o:["Overt or covert","Criminal or terrorist","Environmental and technological threats","Insider or outsider"],a:2,e:"التهديدات غير الجنائية تُقسم إلى بيئية (Environmental) مثل الزلازل والفيضانات، وتقنية (Technological) مثل انقطاع الكهرباء وتعطل الأنظمة والتسرب الكيميائي."},
{d:"D",q:"A security container without insulation is evaluated for impact resistance. What drop-test height must it withstand?",o:["15 feet","20 feet","30 feet","22 feet"],a:2,e:"حسب الإجابة المعتمدة: الحاوية الأمنية غير المعزولة يجب أن تتحمل اختبار سقوط من ارتفاع 30 قدماً دون أن تنفتح أو تتعرض محتوياتها للخطر."},
{d:"I",q:"You are managing a large PPS (Physical Protection System) installation project for a high-security facility. The project plan includes hundreds of tasks, some of which can run concurrently because they are not linked by strict finish-to-start constraints. These are considered parallel activities. During a scheduling review, the client asks which task cannot typically be executed in parallel with others due to dependency requirements. Which of the following is typically NOT a parallel activity?",o:["Running conduit installation while mounting camera brackets","Conducting operator training while finalizing system commissioning","Performing software configuration while installing door hardware"],a:1,e:"تدريب المشغلين يعتمد على نظام مكتمل ومُشغَّل، فلا يبدأ عادة قبل انتهاء التشغيل التجريبي (Commissioning)، أي أن بينهما علاقة «انتهاء ثم بدء». تمديد الأنابيب وتركيب الحوامل أو برمجة النظام وتركيب الأقفال يمكن تنفيذها بالتوازي."},
{d:"D",q:"A museum plans to protect high-value items using object detection sensors. Which objects are typically protected using this method?",o:["Fridges, artworks, safes, doors, drawers","Filing cabinets, safes, desks, artworks, models, statues, expensive equipment","Printers, computers, doors, safes","All of the above"],a:1,e:"حساسات حماية الأجسام (Object/Proximity sensors) تحمي أشياء محددة عالية القيمة، مثل الخزائن وخزائن الملفات والمكاتب واللوحات الفنية والتماثيل والمجسمات والمعدات الثمينة. الأبواب والثلاجات لا تُحمى بهذه الطريقة."},
{d:"D",q:"A security consultant is designing perimeter lighting for a critical infrastructure site. The client insists on using High-Intensity Discharge (HID) lamps for cost and durability reasons. The consultant must select the most energy-efficient HID lamp type to minimize operating costs while maintaining required illumination levels for deterrence and surveillance. Which HID lamp type offers the highest energy efficiency for perimeter lighting applications?",o:["Mercury vapour","Low pressure sodium","High pressure sodium","Metal halide"],a:1,e:"الصوديوم منخفض الضغط (LPS) هو الأعلى كفاءة، بما يصل إلى نحو 200 لومن لكل واط. عيبه ضعف إظهار الألوان، لأن ضوءه أصفر أحادي اللون. الترتيب التقريبي من الأعلى كفاءة: LPS ثم HPS ثم Metal halide ثم Mercury vapour."},
{d:"A",q:"A security manager begins developing a new security program. What is the earliest planning step?",o:["Fill vacant positions","Identify resources","Determine program objectives","Identify needs"],a:2,e:"حسب الإجابة المعتمدة: أول خطوة هي تحديد أهداف البرنامج، لأن كل ما بعدها من موارد ووظائف واحتياجات يُبنى على هذه الأهداف."},
{d:"D",q:"A security system uses cards that store data via microscopic laser-burned patterns. What type of access control card is this?",o:["Laser card","Wiegand card","OCR card","48 bit proximity cards"],a:0,e:"البطاقة الليزرية (Laser/Optical card) تخزن البيانات في نقاط مجهرية محفورة بالليزر، مثل الأقراص الضوئية. بطاقة Wiegand تعتمد على أسلاك مغناطيسية مدمجة."},
{d:"D",q:"A camera automatically amplifies video signals to maintain consistent output in varying light. What feature performs this function?",o:["Sensitivity adjuster","Super dynamics","Automatic gain control","Autofocus"],a:2,e:"التحكم التلقائي بالكسب (AGC) يضخم إشارة الفيديو تلقائياً عندما يقل الضوء، ليبقى مستوى الصورة ثابتاً. عيبه زيادة التشويش (Noise) في الإضاءة الضعيفة جداً."},
{d:"D",q:"A security integrator is configuring CCTV cameras for a high-security facility where subjects often appear against bright backgrounds, such as large glass windows or open gates. To ensure clear visibility of faces and details, the integrator must enable features that compensate for backlight conditions. Which combination of features is most effective for handling backlight compensation in CCTV cameras?",o:["Auto iris lens, peak average, masking, electronic iris, super dynamics autofocus, privacy blocking","Auto iris lens, peak average, masking, electronic iris, super dynamics autofocus, image protection","Automatic gain control, auto iris lens, super dynamics, electronic shuttering, image protection","A or B"],a:3,e:"ميزات معالجة الإضاءة الخلفية الأساسية هي: العدسة ذات القزحية التلقائية، وضبط Peak/Average، والإخفاء (Masking)، والقزحية الإلكترونية، والنطاق الديناميكي الواسع (Super dynamics). هذه موجودة في A وB معاً، لذلك الإجابة A أو B."},
{d:"A",q:"During PPS planning, a requirements document is developed. What does it primarily identify?",o:["The requirements of the stakeholders","The resources and budget required to implement the system","The primary reasons for implementing measures or updating an old system","The scope of the implementation"],a:2,e:"وثيقة المتطلبات تحدد أساساً الأسباب الرئيسية لتنفيذ إجراءات جديدة أو تحديث نظام قديم، أي «لماذا» نحتاج النظام. الميزانية والنطاق تأتي بعد ذلك."},
{d:"D",q:"A security consultant is inspecting the perimeter protection of a high-security facility. The site uses a chain-link fence as the primary barrier. During the audit, the consultant notes that although the fence meets height and gauge specifications, its effectiveness is compromised due to a common installation oversight. Which failure most commonly negates the effectiveness of a chain-link fence?",o:["Establish and maintain a clear zone along the fence","Install and monitor a fence intrusion detection alarm system","Install warning signs on the fence at intervals not exceeding 50 feet","Patrol the fence line at least twice on each security officer shift"],a:0,e:"أكثر ما يُفشل السياج الشبكي هو عدم الحفاظ على منطقة خالية (Clear zone) على جانبيه. الأشجار والمباني والمعدات الملاصقة للسياج تساعد المتسلل على التسلق وتحجب الرؤية. ملاحظة: صياغة الخيار في المصدر تصف الإجراء الصحيح، والمقصود هو الإخلال به."},
{d:"D",q:"A security engineer is tasked with improving coverage in a large storage facility using intrusion detection sensors. The goal is to double the coverage area without significantly increasing wiring or equipment costs. The engineer considers sensors that operate by detecting changes in low-frequency sound waves or ultrasonic signals, offering enhanced volumetric detection compared to single-point sensors. Which sensor type provides virtually double the coverage of single detectors at almost the same wiring and equipment cost?",o:["Ultrasonic detector","Microwave Doppler sensor","Ultrasonic double sensor","Passive infrared sensor"],a:2,e:"الحساس فوق الصوتي المزدوج (Ultrasonic double sensor) فيه وحدتا إرسال واستقبال في جهاز واحد تغطيان اتجاهين، فيعطي تغطية تقارب الضعف بتكلفة أسلاك ومعدات قريبة من تكلفة الحساس المفرد."},
{d:"D",q:"A security consultant is reviewing the perimeter fencing design for a high-security facility. The specification includes barbed wire outriggers to deter climbing attempts. During the design review, the consultant emphasizes that the positioning of these outriggers is critical for effectiveness and compliance with industry standards. How should the outriggers on a security fence be positioned?",o:["On a 45 degree angle pointing away from the building","On a 45 degree angle pointing toward the building","Pointing either way as it really doesn’t matter","None of the above"],a:0,e:"الأذرع العلوية (Outriggers) تُركَّب بزاوية 45 درجة متجهة للخارج بعيداً عن المبنى، أي نحو المتسلل القادم من الخارج، لتصعّب عليه التسلق. إذا كان الهدف منع الخروج، كما في السجون، توجَّه للداخل."},
{d:"I",q:"You are managing a PPS (Physical Protection System) implementation for a high-security facility. The project involves multiple vendors, complex integration, and strict compliance requirements. While installation and commissioning demand significant coordination, the client asks: “Which activity will require the most sustained project management effort throughout the entire lifecycle to prevent cost overruns and schedule delays?”",o:["Initial risk assessment and concept design","Procurement and vendor selection","Project scope control and change management","System installation and integration"],a:2,e:"ضبط النطاق وإدارة التغيير نشاط مستمر طوال عمر المشروع، بخلاف الأنشطة الأخرى التي تحدث في مرحلة واحدة. توسع النطاق دون ضبط (Scope creep) هو السبب الأول لتجاوز التكلفة والوقت."},
{d:"D",q:"When classifying perimeter barriers, which two main categories are used?",o:["Natural and structural","Natural and non-natural","Man-made and structural","Natural and contrived"],a:0,e:"الحواجز المحيطية نوعان: طبيعية (Natural) مثل الأنهار والتلال والمنحدرات، وإنشائية (Structural) من صنع الإنسان مثل الأسوار والجدران والبوابات."},
{d:"D",q:"A security manager is designing entry control procedures for a high-security facility. The plan includes checkpoints where people, packages, and vehicles are screened using X-ray scanners, metal detectors, and explosive detection systems. The client asks what primary security function this screening process serves. Screening of people, packages, and vehicles primarily serves which security function?",o:["Explosive devices and other weapon screening","Drug and alcohol screening","Access control","Physical security inspection"],a:0,e:"الغرض الأساسي من فحص الأشخاص والطرود والمركبات بأجهزة الأشعة وكواشف المعادن والمتفجرات هو كشف العبوات الناسفة والأسلحة ومنع دخولها، أي فحص المواد المحظورة (Contraband screening)."},
{d:"D",q:"A waterfront facility is conducting a vulnerability assessment after identifying that intruders could approach via piers under low-light conditions. To enhance threat detection capability, the security designer specifies protective lighting for open pier decks to ensure cameras and guards can identify suspicious activity effectively. What minimum illumination level should be provided on open pier decks to meet security standards for threat detection?",o:["1.5 foot candles","2.0 foot candles","0.5 foot candles","1.0 foot candle"],a:3,e:"المعيار لأرصفة الموانئ المفتوحة (Open pier decks) هو 1.0 قدم-شمعة كحد أدنى. رقم يُحفظ للامتحان مع رقم 0.2 الخاص بمنطقة الاستبعاد في السؤال 40."},
{d:"A",q:"A security consultant is conducting a Physical Security Survey for a large corporate campus. The survey aims to identify vulnerabilities and recommend improvements. During a review meeting, the client asks which of the following items is NOT typically included in the scope of a physical security survey. Which item does the survey NOT directly provide?",o:["Employee morale and job satisfaction levels","Existing physical barriers and perimeter protection","Access control systems and intrusion detection measures","Security policies, procedures, and compliance with standards"],a:0,e:"المسح الأمني يفحص الحواجز والمحيط وأنظمة التحكم بالدخول والإنذار والسياسات والإجراءات. معنويات الموظفين ورضاهم الوظيفي من شأن الموارد البشرية، وليست من نطاق المسح."},
{d:"D",q:"A security designer reviews sensor types used for object protection. Which sensor is NOT classified as a point or proximity sensor?",o:["Pressure mat","Ultrasonic","Taut wire","Capacitance"],a:1,e:"الحساس فوق الصوتي حساس حجمي (Volumetric) يغطي مساحة كاملة. حساسات النقطة أو القرب تشمل حصيرة الضغط والسلك المشدود (Taut wire) والسعة الكهربائية (Capacitance)."},
{d:"A",q:"A security manager is drafting new security policies and procedures for a multinational corporation. During a compliance review, the legal team reminds the manager that these documents must align with applicable regulations to avoid liability and ensure enforceability. Security policies and procedures should conform to which laws?",o:["Federal","State","Local law and regulation","All of the above"],a:3,e:"يجب أن تتوافق السياسات مع كل مستويات القانون: الفيدرالي والولائي والمحلي. هذا مرتبط بالسؤال 26 الذي كان خطؤه كلمة «المحلية فقط»."},
{d:"D",q:"During a perimeter security upgrade, the installation team notices that certain environmental conditions could compromise the reliability of microwave intrusion sensors. The project manager asks for a list of issues that might cause false alarms or performance degradation. What potential problems are commonly associated with microwave detectors?",o:["Vibrations or movement of mounting surface","Reflection of microwave energy off metal objects in the protected area (fan blades)","Penetration of thin walls or glass, if motion or large metal objects are present","All problems identified above"],a:3,e:"مشاكل حساسات الميكروويف: اهتزاز سطح التركيب، وانعكاس الموجات عن الأجسام المعدنية كشفرات المراوح، واختراق الموجات للجدران الرقيقة والزجاج فتكتشف حركة خارج المنطقة المحمية. كلها صحيحة."},
{d:"D",q:"During a security system audit, the maintenance team reports frequent nuisance alarms from Passive Infrared (PIR) detectors installed in the facility. The facility manager wants to understand what environmental or operational factors could be causing these issues before approving replacements. What potential problems are commonly associated with PIR detectors?",o:["Turbulence and drafts — if the air is blowing directly onto the unit or causes a rapid change in temperature of objects in the path of detection","Forms of stray motion — drapes blowing, hanging objects or displays, small animals","Changing temperatures may cause false alarms (hot spots in machinery, sunlight etc.)","All of the above"],a:3,e:"حساس PIR يكتشف تغير الأشعة تحت الحمراء (الحرارة)، لذلك يتأثر بتيارات الهواء الدافئ أو البارد، والأجسام المتحركة كالستائر والحيوانات، ومصادر الحرارة كأشعة الشمس والآلات. كلها صحيحة."},
{d:"D",q:"A security engineer is evaluating ultrasonic intrusion detectors for a high-security warehouse. During the design review, the engineer warns the client about potential limitations and environmental factors that could affect the reliability of these sensors. What are common potential problems associated with ultrasonic detectors?",o:["Temperature or humidity can affect the range of the ultrasonic","Noise caused by air hissing, bells, telephones","Turbulence and draft, hanging displays, moving draperies and small pets","All of the above"],a:3,e:"الحساس فوق الصوتي يعتمد على موجات صوتية عالية التردد، لذلك تؤثر فيه الحرارة والرطوبة لأنهما تغيران سرعة الصوت، والضوضاء عالية التردد كصفير الهواء والأجراس، وتيارات الهواء والأجسام المتحركة. كلها صحيحة."},
{d:"I",q:"Before starting the installation of a new Physical Protection System (PPS), the contractor visits the site to confirm that conditions match the design specifications. The project manager reminds the team that an additional requirement must be met to ensure compliance and accountability before work begins. In addition to verifying site conditions, what should the company require from the contractor?",o:["Not disconnect any signal lines or equipment or create any equipment downtime without prior written approval of the company","Prepare a written report of all changes to the site or conditions that will affect the performance of the system and to take necessary corrective action","Disconnect all signal lines or equipment and create equipment downtime without prior written approval of the company"],a:0,e:"حسب الإجابة المعتمدة: يُلزم المقاول بعدم فصل أي خطوط إشارة أو معدات، أو التسبب بتوقف أي نظام، إلا بموافقة كتابية مسبقة من الشركة. الهدف ألا تبقى المنشأة بلا حماية أثناء التركيب."},
{d:"D",q:"Potential problems for ultrasonic detectors are:",o:["Temperature or humidity can affect the range of the ultrasonic","Noise caused by air hissing, bells, telephones","Turbulence and draft, hanging displays, moving draperies and small pets","All of the above"],a:3,e:"هذا تكرار للسؤال 66 بصياغة مختصرة. مشاكل الحساس فوق الصوتي هي الحرارة والرطوبة، والضوضاء عالية التردد، وتيارات الهواء والأجسام المتحركة."},
{d:"D",q:"Probably the most widely-used lock for both exterior building doors and interior room doors is the:",o:["Warded lock","Pin tumbler lock","Disc tumbler lock","Lever lock"],a:1,e:"قفل المسامير (Pin tumbler) هو الأكثر استخداماً في الأبواب الخارجية والداخلية. القفل ذو الحواجز (Warded) قديم وضعيف أمنياً، وقفل الأقراص (Disc tumbler) شائع في السيارات والأدراج."},
{d:"I",q:"Project management can deliver many benefits. Some are evident and some are hidden. Which of the following are not some of the most important?",o:["Putting project goals and expectations on paper encourages open communications and provides a commitment and focal point for the project team throughout the process","The structured project process produces comprehensive training and documentation","Productivity of each project team member is reduced due to reporting requirements","Project controls provide early warnings of time and cost overruns"],a:2,e:"انخفاض إنتاجية أعضاء الفريق بسبب متطلبات التقارير ليس فائدة، بل هو عيب. باقي الخيارات فوائد حقيقية لإدارة المشاريع: توثيق الأهداف، وإنتاج التدريب والوثائق، والإنذار المبكر بالتجاوزات."},
{d:"I",q:"Project management can deliver many benefits. Which of the following is not a benefit?",o:["The customer usually gets what they ask for — a fully documented system that performs to specification","Techniques leveraged from experience help to accelerate projects, reduce risk and assure higher quality output","Productivity is increased by making maximum use of all resources. The project manager is held accountable for his or her assigned tasks","Project controls provide early warnings of time and cost overruns"],a:2,e:"حسب الإجابة المعتمدة: الخيار C هو المستثنى. الصياغة الصحيحة للفائدة أن كل عضو في الفريق يُحاسب على مهامه المسندة إليه، وليس مدير المشروع وحده."},
{d:"I",q:"Project management software is a recommended tool for any project with multiple activities. When entering activities into project management software, which is the recommended order of doing so?",o:["Order of importance","By dependencies","Chronologically","Work effort required"],a:2,e:"تُدخل الأنشطة في برنامج إدارة المشاريع بالترتيب الزمني (Chronologically)، أي بترتيب حدوثها، ثم تُربط الاعتماديات بينها بعد ذلك."},
{d:"D",q:"Psychological testing has demonstrated that the efficiency of console-operator assessment improves as the number of console monitors is reduced. What is the maximum recommended number of monitors?",o:["2–3","4–6","6–8","8–10"],a:1,e:"الحد الأقصى الموصى به هو 4 إلى 6 شاشات لكل مشغل. بعد ذلك ينخفض انتباه المشغل وقدرته على تقييم الإنذارات بشكل ملحوظ."},
{d:"D",q:"Response time from the moment of detection to the moment of arrival on the scene is an important factor in the design of an intrusion detection system. Which of the following sensor types provides the least amount of notice time?",o:["Ultrasonic sensor","Volumetric sensor","Microwave sensor","Piezoelectric sensor"],a:1,e:"الحساسات الحجمية (Volumetric) تكتشف المتسلل بعد أن يصبح داخل المساحة المحمية، أي في مرحلة متأخرة، فيبقى وقت قليل للاستجابة. حساسات المحيط والحدود تكتشفه مبكراً وتعطي وقتاً أطول."},
{d:"D",q:"Relative to alarms, direct wire, circuit, multiplex, digital communicators, telephone dialer, radio transmission and video verification are types of?",o:["Alarm transmission types","Alarm control types","Components of a central station system","Signaling systems"],a:0,e:"كل هذه طرق لنقل إشارة الإنذار من الموقع إلى مركز المراقبة (Alarm transmission)، مثل السلك المباشر والمُجمِّع والمتصل الرقمي والراديو."},
{d:"D",q:"Relative to CCTV standard capabilities, this aspect of CCTV is described as having visual information of an identifying and descriptive nature during an incident. This is referred to as?",o:["Visual surveillance","Visual assessment","Visual documentation","Visual assurance"],a:2,e:"التوثيق المرئي (Visual documentation) هو تسجيل معلومات تعريفية ووصفية عن الحادثة لاستخدامها لاحقاً كدليل. التقييم المرئي (Visual assessment) هو تقييم الإنذار لحظة حدوثه."},
{d:"D",q:"Relative to CCTV systems automated to respond through a trigger, the trigger response may be to?",o:["Improve the resolution","Bring the image to the attention of a guard","Improve the number of images recorded per second","All or any of the above"],a:3,e:"عند حدوث محفز (Trigger) مثل حركة أو إنذار، يمكن للنظام أن يرفع الدقة، أو يعرض الصورة على شاشة الحارس، أو يزيد عدد الإطارات المسجلة في الثانية، أو يفعل ذلك كله."},
{d:"A",q:"Risk can be defined as:",o:["Potential occurrence and effectiveness of countermeasures in place","Cost of risk insurance and capacity for potential loss","Capacity for potential loss and ability to respond","The potential for a loss or damage to an asset"],a:0,e:"الإجابة المعتمدة في المصدر هي A. انتبه: تعريف ASIS المعتاد للخطر هو «احتمال حدوث خسارة أو ضرر لأصل» (الخيار D). راجع المرجع الرسمي قبل الامتحان، فمفتاح الإجابة هنا محل نقاش."},
{d:"A",q:"Risk management is:",o:["Determining measures and safeguards to mitigate the threats and reduce vulnerabilities","Buying insurance to cover expected losses","Identifying the impact of various threats on assets","Quantifying the cost of loss events"],a:0,e:"إدارة المخاطر هي تحديد الإجراءات والضمانات التي تخفف التهديدات وتقلل الثغرات. التأمين أداة واحدة من أدوات نقل الخطر، وتحديد الأثر وتقدير التكلفة جزء من تحليل المخاطر وليس الإدارة كلها."},
{d:"D",q:"Security vaults differ from safes in that:",o:["They are tested by Underwriters Laboratories for burglary resistance","They do not have both fire and burglary resisting properties","Steel is used","They are permanently affixed to the building"],a:3,e:"الفرق الجوهري أن غرفة الخزينة (Vault) جزء ثابت من المبنى، بينما الخزنة (Safe) وحدة يمكن نقلها حتى لو كانت ثقيلة."},
{d:"D",q:"Sensors and system electronics need different types of housing depending on their placement. Which of the following housings should be used for hazardous environments?",o:["Exterior housings","Interior housings","Noncorrosive housings","Housings specified by the manufacturer’s requirements"],a:3,e:"في البيئات الخطرة، كالقابلة للانفجار أو المليئة بالمواد الكيميائية، يُستخدم الغلاف الذي تحدده متطلبات الشركة المصنعة، لأنها تعرف الشهادات المطلوبة لجهازها، مثل الأغلفة المقاومة للانفجار."},
{d:"D",q:"Service of freight elevators poses special problems in all high rise structures as they often service all levels of the building. The entire building security program may be compromised unless the service cars are?",o:["Programmed not to access sensitive floors without special arrangements","Locked at hoistway doors on sensitive floors or locked at service vestibule or lobby doors where applicable","Have the same security measures in place as all building elevators","Both A and B"],a:3,e:"مصاعد الخدمة تصل لكل الطوابق، لذلك تُبرمج حتى لا تصل للطوابق الحساسة إلا بترتيب خاص، وتُقفل أبوابها على تلك الطوابق أو عند ردهات الخدمة. الإجراءان معاً مطلوبان."},
{d:"D",q:"Size and space requirements for security system solutions such as the number of card holders for an access control system, number of alarm zones monitored, number of access controlled doors, etc. is a measure of?",o:["Metrics","Capability","Features","Capacity"],a:3,e:"السعة (Capacity) تعني الحجم الذي يستوعبه النظام: عدد حاملي البطاقات، وعدد الأبواب، وعدد مناطق الإنذار. القدرة (Capability) تعني ما يستطيع النظام فعله."},
{d:"D",q:"Sliding glass doors can be pried out of their track. What would you recommend to mitigate this risk?",o:["Encourage the owner to make sure the door is locked at all times","Put a charley bar in the track when closed","Improve the locking mechanism on the handle of the door","Fit a sliding security screen to the exterior of the sliding glass door"],a:1,e:"قضيب تشارلي (Charley bar) يوضع في المجرى عند إغلاق الباب، فيمنع تحريكه أو خلعه من المسار. هو حل بسيط ورخيص وفعال للأبواب المنزلقة."},
{d:"I",q:"Specify the type of conduit that should be used for all interior wiring.",o:["Rigid PVC","Rigid galvanized steel","Flexible PVC","Aluminum"],a:1,e:"الأنابيب الفولاذية المجلفنة الصلبة (Rigid galvanized steel) تحمي الأسلاك من العبث والقطع والتلف، وهي المعيار في التمديدات الأمنية الداخلية."},
{d:"D",q:"Standard barbed wire is 12 gauge twisted double-strand with:",o:["4 point barbs","3 point barbs","5 point barbs","6 point barbs"],a:0,e:"السلك الشائك القياسي: سلكان مجدولان بسماكة 12 gauge، وأشواك رباعية الرؤوس (4-point barbs). الأشواك تكون على مسافات حوالي 4 بوصات."},
{d:"D",q:"Standard barbed wire is twisted double-strand:",o:["9 Gauge","14 Gauge","13 Gauge","12 Gauge"],a:3,e:"السماكة القياسية للسلك الشائك هي 12 gauge، سلكان مجدولان. الرقم نفسه في الأسئلة 86 و87 و103."},
{d:"D",q:"Strands of barbed wire or tape used as a top guard on a fence should be spaced:",o:["2 inches apart","3 inches apart","4 inches apart","6 inches apart"],a:3,e:"خيوط السلك الشائك أو الشريط الشائك في أعلى السياج (Top guard) تكون المسافة بينها 6 بوصات."},
{d:"I",q:"Systems administration training covers which of the following topics?",o:["Day to day operations","Determining and implementing system operational parameters","Assessment of alarm conditions","Network communications and diagnostics"],a:1,e:"تدريب مدير النظام يركز على تحديد إعدادات التشغيل وتطبيقها، مثل الصلاحيات والجداول ومستويات الوصول. العمليات اليومية تخص تدريب المراقبة (السؤال 90)."},
{d:"I",q:"Systems monitoring training covers which of the following topics?",o:["Day to day operations","Determining and implementing system operational parameters","Assessment of alarm conditions","Network communications and diagnostics"],a:0,e:"تدريب المراقبة (Monitoring) موجه لمشغلي غرفة التحكم ويغطي العمليات اليومية. قارن بالسؤال 89 الخاص بتدريب مدير النظام."},
{d:"D",q:"Techniques to detect cyber attacks on computer systems are called?",o:["Line supervision","IT security","Firewalls","Anti-virus software"],a:0,e:"حسب الإجابة المعتمدة: الإشراف على الخطوط (Line supervision) هو مراقبة خط الاتصال واكتشاف أي عبث أو اعتراض أو قطع فيه، وفي الأنظمة الرقمية يمتد هذا إلى كشف الهجمات على مسار الاتصال."},
{d:"A",q:"Technology is the driving force behind modern physical protection systems that have evolved to meet the increasing sophistication of threats. Which of the following is not true with respect to technology and security?",o:["Technology may improve security, but it requires more manpower to operate","Technology handled properly can augment human capabilities","Technology implemented poorly can actually reduce the level of security at a facility","A successful security concept will emphasize integration of security system with human resources"],a:0,e:"العبارة الخاطئة أن التقنية تحتاج قوى بشرية أكثر. الصحيح أن التقنية عادة تقلل الحاجة للقوى البشرية وتعزز قدراتها. باقي العبارات صحيحة."},
{d:"D",q:"Telephone, computer and alarm systems all use the telecommunications path and are vulnerable to attack along the telephone cable system. For a high security building what would you recommend to protect this infrastructure?",o:["Two physically separated paths for telecommunications cable to separate telephone centres","For enclosed spaces where cable is housed, install intrusion detection devices on access points","Harden any exposed cable by resistive construction","All of the above"],a:3,e:"كلها إجراءات صحيحة: مساران منفصلان إلى مقسمين مختلفين حتى لا ينقطع الاتصال بقطع مسار واحد، وكشف التسلل على غرف الكابلات، وتقوية الكابلات المكشوفة بإنشاءات مقاومة."},
{d:"A",q:"To effectively analyse lighting deficiencies, you should:",o:["Make a morning appointment to visit the facility owner and observe lighting levels","Ask the client what lighting levels are present around and within the facility","Go to the building at night and study the possible methods of entry and areas where inadequate lighting will aid a burglar","Use a light meter"],a:2,e:"قصور الإضاءة لا يظهر إلا في الليل. زر المبنى ليلاً وانظر إليه بعين اللص: أين المداخل المظلمة؟ أين يستطيع الاختباء؟"},
{d:"D",q:"The acceptable vault construction of insulated doors is a minimum reinforced concrete wall, floor and ceiling of:",o:["12\"","10\"","8\"","6\""],a:3,e:"حسب الإجابة المعتمدة: الحد الأدنى لجدران وأرضية وسقف غرفة الخزينة ذات الأبواب المعزولة هو 6 بوصات من الخرسانة المسلحة."},
{d:"A",q:"The account that lists cash on hand, land, buildings and property is called the:",o:["Owner’s account","Assets account","Liabilities account","Equity account"],a:1,e:"حساب الأصول (Assets) يضم كل ما تملكه المنشأة: النقد والأراضي والمباني والممتلكات. الخصوم (Liabilities) هي ما على المنشأة من التزامات."},
{d:"D",q:"The aim of writing the purpose of each camera in the CCTV system is to?",o:["Weigh the security risk of each area to be viewed and integrate viable options into the proposed system to mitigate these risks","Determine whether overt or covert cameras are required for each camera","Determine how many cameras you need and where","Determine the why the proposed system is required, how it may be used and what risks are expected to be mitigated as a result of its implementation"],a:0,e:"كتابة غرض كل كاميرا تعني تقييم خطر كل منطقة ستراقبها الكاميرا، ودمج الخيارات المناسبة لمعالجته. أما «لماذا وكيف وماذا» (D) فهي غرض النظام كاملاً، وهي موضوع السؤال 133."},
{d:"A",q:"The approach to the PSS for a security practitioner is:",o:["Inside-out","Outside-in","Back-front","Front-back"],a:1,e:"حسب الإجابة المعتمدة: نهج المسح الأمني (Physical Security Survey) يبدأ من الخارج إلى الداخل، من المحيط ثم المبنى ثم الأصول، مثل السؤال 10."},
{d:"A",q:"The appropriate level of physical security for a company is contingent upon the value of the company assets, potential threats to these assets, associated with protecting the assets. Which of the following statements is not correct in this regard?",o:["Low cost security elements, such as cameras, alarms, guard force, should be in place for all critical assets","Recommending that a company eliminate a security element because of high cost may place critical assets at unwarranted risk","Recommending implementation of expensive security elements could result in little improvement of the overall security posture","Locking doors, wearing ID badges and escorting visitors improve the security posture without significant cost"],a:0,e:"العبارة الخاطئة أن الكاميرات والإنذارات والحراس «عناصر منخفضة التكلفة». هذه عناصر مكلفة، والعناصر الرخيصة فعلاً هي قفل الأبواب وارتداء البطاقات ومرافقة الزوار (الخيار D)."},
{d:"I",q:"The argument usually used by contracted guard representatives as a selling point in their service is:",o:["Better trained","Non-union","No administrative problems","Reduction in cost"],a:3,e:"الحجة الأولى لشركات الحراسة المتعاقدة هي خفض التكلفة مقارنة بالحراسة الداخلية (Proprietary)، لأنها تتحمل الرواتب والتأمينات والتوظيف والتدريب."},
{d:"D",q:"The armature in an electronic lock should be specified to operate on what voltage?",o:["12–20","12–24","16–24","16–32"],a:1,e:"المحرك (Armature) في الأقفال الإلكترونية يعمل عادة على جهد 12 إلى 24 فولت تيار مستمر، وهو المعيار في أنظمة التحكم بالدخول."},
{d:"D",q:"The balanced magnetic switch is typically used to detect:",o:["Sound","Tampering","Heat","The opening of a door or window"],a:3,e:"المفتاح المغناطيسي المتوازن (BMS) يكتشف فتح الباب أو النافذة. يتفوق على المفتاح المغناطيسي العادي بأنه يقاوم محاولة خداعه بمغناطيس خارجي."},
{d:"D",q:"The barbed wire of a security fence should be a pair of:",o:["10-gauge twisted wires","14-gauge twisted wires","12-gauge twisted wires","16-gauge twisted wires"],a:2,e:"السلك الشائك: سلكان مجدولان بسماكة 12 gauge. نفس معلومة السؤالين 86 و87."},
{d:"I",q:"The bidder’s conference enables contractors to see the facility, view any possible installation problems and ask questions about the design and installation requirements. Which of the following is not a good practice for the bidder’s conference?",o:["Respond to questions by each contractor directly without copying the other bidders","Require all prospective bidders to attend the conference","Conduct a walk through of the installation and show where the PPS will be installed","Prepare minutes of the bidders conference and issue to all attendees"],a:0,e:"الرد على أسئلة مقاول واحد دون إطلاع البقية يخل بمبدأ العدالة والشفافية. يجب أن تُرسل كل الأسئلة وإجاباتها إلى جميع المتقدمين حتى يتنافسوا على أساس المعلومات نفسها."},
{d:"I",q:"The bidder’s conference must be organized and executed with precision. It should begin with opening remarks from the project team leader who should introduce the evaluation team. Which is the next step in the process?",o:["The project team leader to present the agenda identifying the conference guidelines","A member of the evaluation team should discuss the procurement process, identify all steps in the procurement including key dates","The project manager and technical team members should discuss the project’s purpose, results to be produced and the evaluation criteria","Each bidder should introduce himself or herself to the group"],a:3,e:"حسب الإجابة المعتمدة: بعد كلمة الافتتاح وتقديم فريق التقييم، يعرّف كل مقاول بنفسه، ثم يُعرض جدول الأعمال وإجراءات الشراء وأهداف المشروع."},
{d:"A",q:"You are the Head of Security at a coastal office complex. A severe hurricane is forecasted to hit the region within 48 hours, threatening power systems, access control, and the safety of staff and assets. As part of the Business Continuity Management (BCM) plan, you must ensure the facility can continue essential operations and protect personnel during and after the storm. Which of the following best represents the four phases of the Business Continuity cycle you would implement in this scenario?",o:["Reliability, Prevention, Reaction and Recovery","Readiness, Prevention, Reaction and Recovery","Reliability, Proactivity, Response and Recovery","Readiness, Prevention, Response and Recovery"],a:3,e:"مراحل استمرارية الأعمال الأربع: الجاهزية (Readiness)، ثم الوقاية (Prevention)، ثم الاستجابة (Response)، ثم التعافي (Recovery). انتبه للفخ: Response وليس Reaction."},
{d:"D",q:"In a CCTV system, the component responsible for gathering and directing incident light onto the imaging sensor whether a CCD, CMOS, or tube-based device and determining the field of view, depth of focus, and optical resolution is referred to as the:",o:["Image sensor","Lens Assembly","Aperture diaphragm","Shutter mechanism"],a:1,e:"العدسة (Lens assembly) تجمع الضوء وتوجهه إلى الحساس، وتحدد مجال الرؤية وعمق التركيز والدقة البصرية. الحساس (CCD/CMOS) يحول الضوء إلى إشارة فقط."},
{d:"D",q:"A high-rise office building specifies that the card reader-controlled turnstile subsystem must process a minimum of 500 badge holders per hour, maintain low transaction latency, ensure fail-safe operation, and accommodate full building evacuation within 10 minutes with an optimized pedestrian flow rate. This specification is an example of a:",o:["Capacity requirement","Performance parameter","Design specification","Code requirement"],a:1,e:"معيار الأداء (Performance parameter) قابل للقياس الكمي: 500 شخص في الساعة، وزمن معالجة منخفض، وإخلاء خلال 10 دقائق. السعة (Capacity) تعني عدد البطاقات أو الأبواب التي يستوعبها النظام، وليس سرعة المعالجة."},
{d:"A",q:"During World War II, the U.S. Office of Strategic Services (OSS) developed a systematic matrix to assist the French Resistance in identifying high-value enemy targets. The tool was later refined during the Vietnam War and adapted in the 1970s for defensive operations, counterterrorism, and homeland security, especially after 9/11. This matrix evaluates targets using six factors and is known by what acronym?",o:["Criticality, Accessibility, Responsibility, Vulnerability, Effects and Recognisability","Criticality, Affordability, Responsibility, Vulnerability, Effects and Recognisability","Criticality, Accessibility, Recoverability, Vulnerability, Effect, Recognizability","Criticality, Accessibility, Recoverability, Vulnerability, Efforts and Recognisability"],a:2,e:"مصفوفة CARVER: الأهمية (Criticality)، وسهولة الوصول (Accessibility)، وقابلية التعافي (Recoverability)، والقابلية للإصابة (Vulnerability)، والأثر (Effect)، وسهولة التعرف (Recognizability). الفخاخ هي Responsibility وAffordability وEfforts."},
{d:"I",q:"The Change Review Board (CRB) consists of representatives from each of the project’s major concerned parties. What is the most important function of the CRB?",o:["Review the overall progress of the project","Approve additional resources and budget","Give guidance and direction to the project manager","To serve as a clearinghouse for changes to ensure that all important viewpoints are considered"],a:3,e:"أهم وظيفة لمجلس مراجعة التغييرات (CRB) أن يكون مركزاً تمر عبره كل طلبات التغيير (Clearinghouse)، حتى تؤخذ آراء كل الأطراف المعنية في الحسبان قبل الموافقة على أي تغيير."},
{d:"D",q:"A small convenience store experienced a few petty thefts, but the owner had a very limited budget for security. To maximize security without breaking the budget, the owner installed a few dummy cameras in visible locations. Several months later, a theft occurred in an aisle with one of the dummy cameras, and the investigation revealed the camera was non-functional, providing no recorded evidence. While dummy cameras can serve as a visual deterrent, what is the major downside of using “dummy” cameras?",o:["They drain power from the main electrical system, increasing operating costs","The possibility of a lawsuit alleging negligence","A loss of confidence in the effectiveness of the security system","They provide a false sense of security, potentially leaving assets unprotected"],a:3,e:"الكاميرات الوهمية تعطي إحساساً زائفاً بالأمان، فلا تسجّل شيئاً ولا تدعم أي تحقيق، وقد يعتمد عليها الناس ظناً أن أحداً يراقب. وقد تعرّض المنشأة أيضاً لدعاوى إهمال."},
{d:"D",q:"In the design of a CCTV surveillance system, the specification of a camera should be determined primarily by which combination of the following technical parameters?",o:["Manufacturer reputation, warranty duration, cost per unit, and housing color","Mounting height, cable type, monitor size, and lens aesthetics","Power supply type, infrared intensity, brand logo placement, and external finish","Sensitivity to varying illumination levels, optical and digital resolution, functional features such as PTZ or WDR, and system integration/design factors"],a:3,e:"مواصفات الكاميرا تُبنى على أربعة عناصر: الحساسية للإضاءة، والدقة البصرية والرقمية، والميزات الوظيفية مثل PTZ وWDR والرؤية الليلية، وعوامل التكامل مع النظام مثل مجال الرؤية والتوافق مع VMS/NVR."},
{d:"D",q:"In a CCTV system, multiple camera feeds need to be displayed on a limited number of monitors. The device that allows operators to select, combine, or alternate between several video signals for monitoring or recording purposes is known as a:",o:["Camera module","Digital Video Recorder (DVR) / Network Video Recorder (NVR)","Control workstation / Video Management System (VMS)","Switcher / Multiplexer (MUX)"],a:3,e:"المحوّل أو المُجمِّع (Switcher/MUX) يختار بين إشارات الفيديو أو يدمجها أو يبدّل بينها. جهاز DVR/NVR للتخزين والاسترجاع، ونظام VMS للإدارة والأتمتة."},
{d:"A",q:"A security team conducts a requirements analysis. What is the correct sequence of components?",o:["Identification of risks, vulnerabilities, threats, critical assets","Identification of vulnerabilities, critical assets, risks, threats","Identification of threats, risks, critical assets, vulnerabilities","Identification of critical assets, threats, vulnerabilities, risks"],a:3,e:"الترتيب المنطقي: الأصول الحرجة أولاً (ماذا نحمي؟)، ثم التهديدات (ممن نحميه؟)، ثم الثغرات (أين نقاط الضعف؟)، ثم المخاطر وهي نتيجة الثلاثة معاً."},
{d:"A",q:"A security consultant is designing an access control and intrusion detection system for a corporate facility. To determine the degree of protection required, the consultant must analyze key factors that influence system design, cost, and effectiveness. The degree of protection desired in any installation is primarily predicated upon which two factors?",o:["Cost and environmental conditions","Criticality and vulnerability","Cost and vulnerability","Cost and criticality"],a:1,e:"درجة الحماية تُحدد أساساً بعاملين: أهمية الأصل (Criticality)، أي مدى الضرر إذا فُقد، وقابليته للإصابة (Vulnerability)، أي مدى سهولة الوصول إليه. التكلفة قيد على الحل، وليست أساساً لتحديد درجة الحماية."},
{d:"D",q:"The process of detecting the products of combustion or the combustion process is known as:",o:["Fire detection","Heat detection","Life safety detection","Smoke Detection"],a:3,e:"حسب الإجابة المعتمدة: كشف الدخان (Smoke detection) هو كشف نواتج الاحتراق. انتبه: بعض المراجع تعتبر Fire detection المصطلح الأشمل الذي يضم الدخان والحرارة واللهب."},
{d:"A",q:"The development of a security program passes through phases. In an early phase, threats are assessed and vulnerabilities identified. In a following phase, a security program is designed to mitigate the identified vulnerabilities. After that comes:",o:["Planning for change","Implementing and maintaining the program","Developing a program budget","Selling the program to senior management"],a:1,e:"المراحل: تقييم التهديدات والثغرات، ثم تصميم البرنامج، ثم تنفيذه وصيانته. هذا متسق مع السؤال 131."},
{d:"I",q:"A security manager is overseeing the procurement of a new CCTV and access control system for a corporate campus. During the bidding phase, documents are issued to potential vendors to provide detailed project specifications, requirements, and instructions on how to submit their proposals. Which of the following BEST describes these documents?",o:["Contract Documents — the complete set of legal and technical documents defining the project","Request for Proposal (RFP) / Invitation to Tender — documents issued to bidders to provide project details and request proposals","Purchase Orders — documents authorizing the purchase of equipment"],a:0,e:"الإجابة المعتمدة في المصدر هي «وثائق العقد» (Contract Documents)، أي الحزمة الكاملة من الشروط والمواصفات والمخططات التي تصبح جزءاً من العقد. انتبه: الوصف في السؤال قريب جداً من RFP أيضاً، لذلك قد يكون هذا المفتاح محل نقاش."},
{d:"D",q:"A security engineer is evaluating a microwave motion detection system that relies on frequency variations to detect movement within a protected area. The system operates based on the Doppler principle. The Doppler Shift occurs relative to changes in:",o:["A change in the frequency of the reflected signal caused by movement","A change in the amplitude of the transmitted sound signal","Variation in the antenna orientation","Changes in the system voltage"],a:0,e:"تأثير دوبلر هو تغيّر تردد الإشارة المنعكسة بسبب حركة جسم. الحساس يرسل موجة بتردد ثابت، وإذا رجعت بتردد مختلف فهذا يعني أن هناك حركة."},
{d:"D",q:"A security consultant is specifying an electric lockset that operates by means of an electric solenoid, which replaces the mechanical action normally provided by a standard key. The consultant must select from the two common construction types in which these electric locksets are manufactured. In which two configurations are these electric locksets MOST commonly available?",o:["Electric and Mechanical","Magnetic and Electrical","Cylindrical and Mortise","Latch and Deadbolt"],a:2,e:"الأقفال الكهربائية التي تعمل بملف لولبي (Solenoid) تأتي بشكلين: أسطواني (Cylindrical) يُركّب في ثقب دائري، ومدمج (Mortise) يُركّب في تجويف داخل حافة الباب."},
{d:"D",q:"A corporate office building requires an electrified lockset for interior office doors. The design calls for a lock that has a lever handle on both sides of the door and a central cylinder mechanism that controls the locking function. The lock must be easy to install in a standard bored door preparation and allow integration with an access control system. Which type of electrical lockset is MOST appropriate for this application?",o:["Electric deadbolt lock","Mortise style lockset","Electric cylindrical lockset","Electric strike lock"],a:2,e:"الكلمة المفتاحية هي «ثقب قياسي» (Standard bored door). القفل الأسطواني (Cylindrical) يُركّب في ثقب دائري بسيط، ومقبضه على الجانبين. القفل المدمج (Mortise) يحتاج تجويفاً مستطيلاً، وهو موضوع السؤال 122."},
{d:"D",q:"An electrical lockset characterized by a lock housed in a rectangular metal case that is embedded into the edge of a door and enclosed within the thickness of the door is known as a:",o:["Electric deadbolt lock","Mortise style lockset","Cylindrical style lockset","Electric strike lock"],a:1,e:"القفل المدمج (Mortise) صندوق معدني مستطيل يُركّب في تجويف داخل سماكة الباب. هو أقوى وأكثر متانة من القفل الأسطواني، ويُستخدم في الأبواب التجارية."},
{d:"A",q:"A security professional is tasked with conducting a full security survey of a high-rise corporate facility. The survey includes evaluating physical security measures, reviewing policies and procedures, analyzing risks and vulnerabilities, assessing alarm and access control systems, interviewing key personnel, and observing operational practices. After completing the survey, the professional prepares a final report for senior management. What is the primary end result of conducting such a comprehensive security survey?",o:["Recommend a raise for the security manager","To serve as a procedural document that mandates the replacement of all outdated security equipment, implements new policies, and requires staff to be trained in updated operational protocols","To provide a detailed analysis of the facility’s current security operations, including identified deficiencies, potential threats, and vulnerabilities, accompanied by prioritized recommendations for immediate and long-term improvements","To justify a proposed budget for new security technologies, upgrades, and infrastructure improvements, presenting financial requirements alongside a timeline for phased implementation"],a:2,e:"الناتج النهائي للمسح الأمني تحليل مفصل للوضع الحالي، يوضح أوجه القصور والتهديدات والثغرات، ومعه توصيات مرتبة حسب الأولوية. المسح يوصي ولا يُلزم، ولذلك الخيار B خاطئ."},
{d:"D",q:"A facility is upgrading its intrusion detection system. Multiple sensors including motion detectors, door contacts, and glass-break sensors are installed throughout the building. All these sensors are connected to a single piece of equipment that receives their signals, processes them, and determines if an alarm should be activated. What is this central piece of equipment called?",o:["Panel","Alarm control panel","Central processing unit","Multiplexer"],a:1,e:"لوحة التحكم بالإنذار (Alarm control panel) هي العقل المركزي لنظام كشف التسلل: تستقبل إشارات الحساسات وتعالجها وتقرر إطلاق الإنذار أو عدمه."},
{d:"A",q:"A security consultant has completed a comprehensive security survey of a corporate facility, analyzing risks, vulnerabilities, and current security measures. The consultant prepares an Executive Summary to provide management with a concise overview of the findings. Which of the following items is NOT typically included in the Executive Summary of a security survey?",o:["Key findings and overall assessment of the facility’s security posture","Recommendations for improvement and prioritized corrective actions","Detailed schematics and blueprints of all security systems","Identification of major risks and vulnerabilities"],a:2,e:"الملخص التنفيذي مختصر وموجه للإدارة العليا: أهم النتائج والمخاطر والتوصيات. المخططات التفصيلية مكانها الملاحق، وفيها أيضاً معلومات حساسة لا تُعمم."},
{d:"D",q:"A security integrator is designing a CCTV system for a building entrance. To ensure the camera captures clear facial features of visitors, the team must select a lens with the correct focal length. The focal length is determined by the distance from the camera to the primary subject that needs to be viewed. Which factor is used to determine the required focal length of the camera lens?",o:["The field of view","Format size","Distance from camera to scene","None of the above"],a:2,e:"حسب الإجابة المعتمدة وصياغة السؤال نفسه: البُعد البؤري يحدده بُعد الكاميرا عن المشهد. كلما بعد الهدف احتجت بُعداً بؤرياً أطول (تقريب). عملياً يدخل في الحساب أيضاً مجال الرؤية وحجم الحساس."},
{d:"D",q:"A security camera is being installed to monitor a busy outdoor parking lot. During the day, vehicles move quickly across areas of intense sunlight, and traditional cameras with normal exposure settings produce blurred images of moving vehicles. The goal is to capture clear, sharp images of fast-moving objects without overexposing bright areas. Which camera feature allows the sensor to limit exposure time electronically to freeze motion and prevent overexposure?",o:["Electronic shuttering","Masking","Automatic gain control","Super dynamics"],a:0,e:"الغالق الإلكتروني (Electronic shuttering) يقلل زمن التعريض إلكترونياً، فيجمّد الحركة السريعة ويمنع الإفراط في الإضاءة. التحكم بالكسب (AGC) يعمل في الاتجاه المعاكس، أي يضخم الإشارة في الإضاءة الضعيفة."},
{d:"D",q:"A CCTV designer reviews standard lens categories. Which list correctly identifies the five main lens types?",o:["Wide angle, standard, telephoto, varifocal and zoom","Zoom, extended, wide angle, telephoto, varifocal","Varifocal, pan/tilt, zoom, wide angle, standard","Standard, varifocal, smart, wide angle, zoom"],a:0,e:"أنواع العدسات الخمسة: واسعة الزاوية (Wide angle)، وقياسية (Standard)، ومقرِّبة (Telephoto)، ومتغيرة البُعد (Varifocal)، وزووم (Zoom). خيار Pan/tilt حركة للكاميرا وليس نوع عدسة."},
{d:"D",q:"A facility develops a fire response plan. What is always the first step in any fire emergency?",o:["Confinement","Detection","Extinguishment","Escape"],a:1,e:"الخطوة الأولى دائماً هي الكشف (Detection)، فلا يمكن الاحتواء أو الإطفاء أو الإخلاء قبل معرفة وجود الحريق."},
{d:"A",q:"The four broad categories of security measures are?",o:["Electronic security measures, access control systems, professional response, CCTV systems","Access control systems, detection systems, professional response, manpower measures","Guarding, access control systems, electronic security measures, incident response","CCTV, surveillance measures, electronic security measures, manpower"],a:0,e:"حسب الإجابة المعتمدة: الفئات الأربع هي الإجراءات الأمنية الإلكترونية، وأنظمة التحكم بالدخول، والاستجابة المهنية، وأنظمة CCTV."},
{d:"A",q:"A physical security professional has been tasked with developing a comprehensive security plan for a large corporate campus. To ensure the plan is thorough, systematic, and aligned with organizational risk management goals, the security professional follows recognized methodology. This methodology divides the planning process into distinct stages to address assessment, design, implementation, and maintenance of security measures. Which sequence correctly lists these stages?",o:["Risk analysis, security program design, implementation, monitoring","Risk analysis, security program design, implementation, maintenance","Risk analysis, security program design, implementation, management"],a:1,e:"المراحل الأربع: تحليل المخاطر، ثم تصميم البرنامج الأمني، ثم التنفيذ، ثم الصيانة (Maintenance). السؤال نفسه يذكرها: assessment وdesign وimplementation وmaintenance."},
{d:"D",q:"The four most common types of locks used in EAC systems are:",o:["Pin tumbler lock, electric strike lock, electric deadbolt and lever lock","Electric lockset, magnetic lock, cyber lock, electric deadbolt","Magnetic lock, electric strike lock, electric lockset, electric deadbolt","Electric deadbolt, pin tumbler lock, electric lockset, electric deadbolt"],a:2,e:"الأقفال الأربعة الشائعة في التحكم الإلكتروني بالدخول (EAC): القفل المغناطيسي (Maglock)، واللسان الكهربائي (Electric strike)، والقفل الكهربائي (Electric lockset)، والمزلاج الكهربائي (Electric deadbolt). قفل المسامير ميكانيكي."},
{d:"D",q:"A security consultant is preparing a proposal for the installation of a new CCTV system in a corporate facility. Before selecting cameras, storage, and monitoring protocols, the consultant is required to clearly document the objectives of the system. The documentation must communicate why the CCTV system is needed, what it is intended to achieve, and how it supports overall security operations. What is the primary goal of writing the purpose of the proposed CCTV system?",o:["Determine how many cameras you need and where","Determine the “why” the proposed system is required, “how” it may be used and “what” risks are expected to be mitigated as a result of its implementation","Ensure a strong business case is built to ensure funding is approved for the project","Both A and B"],a:1,e:"غرض النظام كاملاً يجيب عن ثلاثة أسئلة: لماذا نحتاجه، وكيف سيُستخدم، وما المخاطر التي سيعالجها. عدد الكاميرات ومواقعها خطوة تأتي بعد ذلك. قارن بالسؤال 97 الخاص بغرض كل كاميرا."},
{d:"A",q:"A multinational organization is conducting an enterprise-wide risk assessment to identify the hazard that has historically caused the most widespread destruction, highest financial losses, and greatest interruption to business operations. Based on historical loss data and risk management principles, which of the following has been the greatest cause of destruction and damage to property?",o:["Burglary and forced entry incidents resulting in theft and structural damage","Acts of vandalism and malicious mischief causing localized property destruction","Fire, including accidental and natural ignition sources, resulting in structural loss and business interruption","Civil unrest"],a:2,e:"تاريخياً، الحريق هو المسبب الأكبر لتدمير الممتلكات وللخسائر المالية ولتوقف الأعمال، وهو يتجاوز السرقة والتخريب بفارق كبير."},
{d:"I",q:"A security supervisor is reviewing documentation to verify that all significant incidents, unusual activities, and changes affecting facility protection have been properly recorded by on-duty personnel. What is the guard’s primary record of significant events affecting facility protection called?",o:["Daily Activity Report","Ingress log","Egress log","Incident Report"],a:0,e:"تقرير النشاط اليومي (Daily Activity Report) هو السجل الأساسي للحارس، ويوثق كل الأحداث المهمة خلال المناوبة. تقرير الحادثة (Incident Report) يُكتب لحادثة واحدة محددة."},
{d:"A",q:"An employee commits a negligent act while performing assigned job duties, resulting in injury to a third party. The injured party seeks to hold the employer legally responsible for the employee’s actions. The imputation of another’s negligence to the employer is described as:",o:["Gross liability","Vicarious liability","Agency liability","Net liability"],a:1,e:"المسؤولية التبعية (Vicarious liability) تعني أن صاحب العمل يتحمل مسؤولية إهمال موظفه إذا وقع الإهمال أثناء أداء الموظف لعمله."},
{d:"I",q:"A contractor is scheduled to conduct training on alarm assessment and dispatch procedures. However, no formal document defines verification steps, dispatch authority or escalation protocols. Before conducting the training, which document should have been developed?",o:["Site orders","Incident response procedures","Alarm assessment and response procedures","A contact list for notification of alarm activity"],a:2,e:"التدريب على تقييم الإنذارات وإرسال الاستجابة يحتاج قبله وثيقة «إجراءات تقييم الإنذار والاستجابة»، التي تحدد خطوات التحقق وصلاحية الإرسال وتسلسل التصعيد. لا يصح التدريب على إجراء غير موثق."},
{d:"I",q:"A security integrator is scheduled to conduct incident response training for a client’s security team. However, during a pre-training discussion, it becomes clear that no formal documentation defining roles, responsibilities, escalation procedures, or response protocols has been finalized between the client and the contractor. Before conducting incident response training, which document should the customer and contractor have developed?",o:["Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs) for daily security operations","Incident Response Plan (IRP) outlining roles, communication flow, and escalation procedures","Service Level Agreement (SLA) defining system uptime and maintenance response times","Risk Assessment Report identifying threats and vulnerabilities"],a:1,e:"خطة الاستجابة للحوادث (IRP) تحدد الأدوار وتدفق الاتصال والتصعيد، ويجب اعتمادها قبل التدريب على الاستجابة. القاعدة نفسها في السؤال 137: الوثيقة أولاً ثم التدريب."},
{d:"D",q:"A facility installs a high-security lock on a hollow wooden door set in a lightweight metal frame. The surrounding wall is standard drywall construction without reinforcement. What is the MOST significant security issue in this scenario?",o:["The lock hardware may not be compliant with local fire and life safety codes","The high-security lock may increase maintenance and lifecycle costs","The drywall construction may interfere with electronic access control integration","The installation creates an imbalance in protection, where the door and wall assembly are weaker than the locking hardware"],a:3,e:"مبدأ الحماية المتوازنة (Balanced protection): قوة النظام تساوي قوة أضعف حلقة فيه. قفل عالي الأمان على باب مجوف وجدار جبس لا فائدة منه، لأن المهاجم سيكسر الباب أو الجدار ولن يقترب من القفل."},
{d:"D",q:"The integrated PPS system requires a database. Which of the following is not true of the database?",o:["Database is a collection of records stored in a computer in a systematic way","A field is a single piece of information; a record one complete set of fields; and a file is a collection of records","The database never stores activity that is used to prepare reports","Databases are organized by fields, records and files"],a:2,e:"العبارة الخاطئة أن قاعدة البيانات «لا تخزن أبداً» سجل النشاط. الصحيح أنها تخزن الأحداث والنشاط، وهذا ما تُبنى عليه التقارير. الحقل (Field) معلومة واحدة، والسجل (Record) مجموعة حقول، والملف (File) مجموعة سجلات."}
];
